---
description: Apply the Pipeline Gurus design language to every visual surface
alwaysApply: true
---

Read `DESIGN.md` before visual work. Use `tokens/tokens.css` for exact values and `assets/pipeline-gurus-logo.jpg` for the supplied logo.

Use Bebas Neue for display and Poppins for body/UI. Use only black, white, and `#F6283F` unless `DESIGN.md` explicitly permits another value. Preserve hard contrast, 40–50% negative space, rectangular geometry, one hero, one logo, and one CTA maximum. Do not invent logo variants, gradients, rounded-card systems, glass effects, or extra accent colors.
